<metadata><name>Galičica trail G-4</name><desc>G-4 is one of Galičica National Park's high ridge trails above 1,600 m. It runs 2.7 km from Sharbojca mountain house (Asan Djura) to Goga peak, climbing about 255 m and descending 0 m in the direction drawn, between 1,467 m and 1,726 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/g-4/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
